# Account errors
E15000 = The account details are invalid.
E15001 = Username is required.
E15002 = Username must be 3–64 characters, start and end with a letter or number, and contain only letters, numbers, dots, hyphens, or underscores.
E15003 = Email address is required.
E15004 = The email address is invalid.
E15005 = That username is already taken.
E15006 = That email address is already registered.
